@api = http://localhost:5100

### 1. Kiem tra may chu dang chay -> 200 OK
GET {{api}}/

### 2. Danh sach san pham -> 200 OK
GET {{api}}/api/products

### 3. Chi tiet san pham ton tai -> 200 OK
GET {{api}}/api/products/1

### 4. San pham khong ton tai -> 404 Not Found + ApiError
GET {{api}}/api/products/999

### 5. Id khong hop le (chuoi abc) -> 404 Not Found (Framework)
GET {{api}}/api/products/abc

### 6. Tao san pham hop le -> 201 Created + Location
# @name createProduct
POST {{api}}/api/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Lap trinh gRPC",
  "description": "Tai lieu bai 5",
  "price": 80000
}

### 7. Tao san pham loi (ten rong, gia am) -> 400 Bad Request + ApiError
POST {{api}}/api/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "San pham loi",
  "description": "",
  "price": -1
}

### 8. Thieu Content-Type khi gui body -> 415 Unsupported Media Type
POST {{api}}/api/products

{
  "name": "Lap trinh gRPC",
  "description": "Tai lieu bai 5",
  "price": 80000
}

### 9. Sai phuong thuc HTTP -> 405 Method Not Allowed
PUT {{api}}/api/products

